FEELING HERE ON THE GROUND IS

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:26.306 line:0%
THIS PROBABLY ISN'T GOING TO GO

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:27.907 line:0%
AWAY, AND THAT'S WHY YOU'RE

